{"source":"github","project_id":"islr-tidymodels-labs","target":"EmilHvitfeldt/ISLR-tidymodels-labs","id":"pr/28","ref":28,"title":"Correct error in Chapter 6","description":"In \"Chapter 6: Linear Model Selection and Regularization\" line 250-255, when evaluating the R-square of lasso regression using `augment`, the model plugged in was `ridge_final_fit` instead of `lasso_final_fit`, resulting in identical R-square value. After correcting the model plugged in to `lasso_final_fit`, the resulting R-square is 0.491, lower than ridge regression model.","published_at":"2022-02-20T19:09:00Z","updated_at":"2022-08-06T16:08:17Z","url":"https://github.com/EmilHvitfeldt/ISLR-tidymodels-labs/pull/28","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"hezht3","merged_at":"2022-08-06T16:08:17Z","state":"MERGED"}}
