{"source":"github","project_id":"islr-tidymodels-labs","target":"EmilHvitfeldt/ISLR-tidymodels-labs","id":"pr/11","ref":11,"title":"completed WIP parts of chapter 4","description":"Hi Emil \r\n\r\nFirst off many thanks for creating this excellent learning resource! I just started out self-learning the ISLR book a couple of weeks back and extensively using your solutions manual to gets to grips with the `tidymodels` ecosystem as well.\r\n\r\nWhen going through chapter 4, I noticed that two sections: Naive Bayes and Poisson Regression were marked as WIP. So, I thought it would be a good learning exercise to try to implement these using the `tidymodels` packages.\r\n\r\nHere's my attempt at the same. I still consider myself very much a beginner when it comes to modelling so do let me know if I have gone wrong anywhere. Happy to makes edits / changes as required.\r\n\r\nThanks again!\r\n\r\nKaustav\r\n","published_at":"2021-09-05T17:17:28Z","updated_at":"2021-09-09T06:14:42Z","url":"https://github.com/EmilHvitfeldt/ISLR-tidymodels-labs/pull/11","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"kaustavSen","merged_at":"2021-09-09T06:14:42Z","state":"MERGED"}}
